sublist menu__link--sublist-caret" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" href="/2.0/specs/servers/verify/"><span title="Verify Server" class="categoryLinkLabel_W154">Verify Server</span></a></div></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-3 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed"><div class="menu__list-item-collapsible"><a class="categoryLink_byQd menu__link menu__link--sublist menu__link--sublist-caret" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" href="/2.0/specs/servers/blockchain/blockchain-api"><span title="Blockchain API" class="categoryLinkLabel_W154">Blockchain API</span></a></div></li></ul></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-2 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed"><div class="menu__list-item-collapsible"><a class="categoryLink_byQd menu__link menu__link--sublist menu__link--sublist-caret" role="button" aria-expanded="false" tabindex="0" href="/2.0/specs/meta-clients/web3modal/api"><span title="Meta-Clients API" class="categoryLinkLabel_W154">Meta-Clients API</span></a></div></li></ul></li><li class="theme-doc-sidebar-item-category theme-doc-sidebar-item-category-level-1 menu__list-item menu__list-item--collapsed menu_outer_list"><div class="menu__list-item-collapsible"><a class="categoryLink_byQd menu__link menu__link--sublist menu__link--sublist-caret" role="button" aria-expanded="false" href="/2.0/glossary/controller"><span title="Glossary" class="categoryLinkLabel_W154">Glossary</span></a></div></li></ul></nav></div></div></aside><main class="docMainContainer_TBSr"><div class="container padding-top--md padding-bottom--lg"><div class="row"><div class="col docItemCol_VOVn"><div class="docItemContainer_Djhp"><article><div class="tocCollapsible_ETCw theme-doc-toc-mobile tocMobile_ITEo"><button type="button" class="clean-btn tocCollapsibleButton_TO0P">On this page</button></div><div class="theme-doc-markdown markdown"><header><h1>Notify Subscription</h1></header>
<p>A Notify subscription is an agreement between a dapp and a wallet to receive future notifications.</p>
<p>A Wallet user will be able to authorize a dapp by sending an authenticated payload with a corresponding identity key and dapp URL as described by <a class="" href="/2.0/specs/clients/notify/authentication">Authentication</a></p>
<p>In order to create subscription a wallet is subscribed by the wallet and sent to the dapp using the Subscribe protocol which is described below.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="user-flow">User Flow<a href="#user-flow" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to User Flow" title="Direct link to User Flow" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<p>The Notify subscribe flow will require a dapp to host a static json file which will contain a DID document compliant with <code>did:web</code> method as specified <a href="https://w3c-ccg.github.io/did-method-web/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">here</a>. In this DID document we will specify a X25519 public key that will be used by the Notify API protocol to derive a symmetric key for the Notify topic.</p>
<p>On the Wallet side we will be able to fetch a list of dapps that expose public keys for Notify subscribe from a registry as for example our WalletConnect Cloud Explorer. These public keys are generated on the Notify server which will be able to listen for new subscriptions sent by the wallet to the subscribe topic which is the sha256 hash of the public key exposed.</p>
<p>Once the wallet user has selected the dapp which they intend to subscribe to, the wallet will be able to subscribe remotely without visiting the dapp.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="subscribe-protocol">Subscribe Protocol<a href="#subscribe-protocol" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Subscribe Protocol" title="Direct link to Subscribe Protocol" translate="no">​</a></h2>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="pre-requisites">Pre-requisites<a href="#pre-requisites" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Pre-requisites" title="Direct link to Pre-requisites" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>The Notify subscribe flow will require a dapp to host a static json file which will contain a DID document compliant with <code>did:web</code> method as specified <a href="https://w3c-ccg.github.io/did-method-web/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">here</a>. In this DID document we will specify a X25519 public key that will be used by the Notify API protocol to derive a symmetric key for the Notify topic.</p>
<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="protocol">Protocol<a href="#protocol" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Protocol" title="Direct link to Protocol" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>Subscribe protocol will be established as follows:</p>
<ol>
<li class="">Wallet fetches public key X from the did<!-- -->:web<!-- --> document</li>
<li class="">Subscribe topic is derived from the sha256 hash of public key X</li>
<li class="">Wallet generates key pair Y</li>
<li class="">Wallet derives symmetric key S with keys X and Y</li>
<li class="">Wallet sends notify subscribe request (type 1 envelope) on subscribe topic with subscriptionAuth</li>
<li class="">Response topic is derived from the sha256 hash of symmetric key S</li>
<li class="">Wallet subscribes to response topic</li>
<li class="">Notify Server receives notify subscribe request on subscribe topic</li>
<li class="">Notify Server derives symmetric key and decrypts subscriptionAuth</li>
<li class="">Notify Server triggers webhook to notify Dapp of new registered address</li>
<li class="">Notify Server generates key pair Z</li>
<li class="">Notify Server derives symmetric key P with keys Y and Z</li>
<li class="">Notify Server responds to notify subscribe request on response topic</li>
<li class="">Wallet receives notify subscribe response on the response topic</li>
<li class="">Wallet derives symmetric key P</li>
<li class="">Notify topic is derived from the sha256 hash of the symmetric key P</li>
<li class="">Wallet subscribes to notify topic for future notify messages</li>
</ol></div><footer class="theme-doc-footer docusaurus-mt-lg"><div class="row margin-top--sm theme-doc-footer-edit-meta-row"><div class="col noPrint_WFHX"><a href="https://github.com/WalletConnect/walletconnect-specs/blob/main/docs/specs/clients/notify/notify-subscription.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="theme-edit-this-page"><svg fill="currentColor" height="20" width="20" viewBox="0 0 40 40" class="iconEdit_Z9Sw" aria-hidden="true"><g><path d="m34.5 11.7l-3 3.1-6.3-6.3 3.1-3q0.5-0.5 1.2-0.5t1.1 0.5l3.9 3.9q0.5 0.4 0.5 1.1t-0.5 1.2z m-29.5 17.1l18.4-18.5 6.3 6.3-18.4 18.4h-6.3v-6.2z"></path></g></svg>Edit this page</a></div><div class="col lastUpdated_JAkA"><span class="theme-last-updated">Last updated<!-- --> on <b><time datetime="2024-09-22T14:31:29.000Z" itemprop="dateModified">Sep 22, 2024</time></b></span></div></div></footer></article><nav class="docusaurus-mt-lg pagination-nav" aria-label="Docs pages"><a class="pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--prev" href="/2.0/specs/clients/notify/notify-server-authentication"><div class="pagination-nav__sublabel">Previous</div><div class="pagination-nav__label">Notify Server Authentication</div></a><a class="pagination-nav__link pagination-nav__link--next" href="/2.0/specs/clients/notify/rpc-methods"><div class="pagination-nav__sublabel">Next</div><div class="pagination-nav__label">RPC Methods</div></a></nav></div></div><div class="col col--3"><div class="tableOfContents_bqdL thin-scrollbar theme-doc-toc-desktop"><ul class="table-of-contents table-of-contents__left-border"><li><a href="#user-flow" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">User Flow</a></li><li><a href="#subscribe-protocol" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Subscribe Protocol</a><ul><li><a href="#pre-requisites" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Pre-requisites</a></li><li><a href="#protocol" class="table-of-contents__link toc-highlight">Protocol</a></li></ul></li></ul></div></div></div></div></main></di